@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title US20 · clases y módulos reales
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class PasswordResetService {
  pending : Map
  requestReset(email)
  resetPassword(token, password, confirmation)
}
class RecoveryError {
  status
}
class passwordResetRoutes <<módulo JS>> {
  createPasswordResetRouter(service)
}
class userModel <<módulo JS>> {
  findUserByEmail(email)
  findUserById(id)
  updateUser(id, updates)
}
class emailService <<módulo JS>> {
  sendPasswordResetEmail(toEmail, resetUrl)
}
class passwordSession <<módulo JS>> {
  expireChangedPasswordSession(req, res, next)
}
passwordResetRoutes --> PasswordResetService : delega
PasswordResetService ..> RecoveryError : lanza
PasswordResetService --> userModel : users (inyectable)
PasswordResetService --> emailService : sendEmail (inyectable)
passwordSession --> userModel : compara passwordVersion
note bottom of PasswordResetService
  Un solo proceso: tokens en memoria.
  bcrypt calcula el hash de la contraseña.
  SHA-256 identifica el token almacenado.
end note
@enduml
